    "arc": "The lesson opens on two identical bean plants \u2014 one on a sunny windowsill, one in a dark cupboard \u2014 where only the windowsill plant grows, and leaves that difference unexplained. The definition of photosynthesis and the standard a complete explanation must meet are then set out and used to explain the pair, while the soil account, the comfort-condition account and the oxygen-intake account are each shown failing. Learners then run the mechanism on a bright-morning greenhouse and on dust-covered leaves, and the lesson closes with one unaided explanation of how a plant gains mass.",
